  "shared_implementation": "LanguageAnalysis retains an immutable normalized response and original service in the shared agent facade. The editor shares one text-review preparation/application flow above the Local workspace and Remote workspace adapters. Installed controller tests also use both ordinary native-language transports.",
  "contract": [
    "Text-only workspace reviews require retained analysis and an exact typed edit match before preparing authority. A command-bearing action cannot be stripped to a text-only review.",
    "Each approval captures the immutable displayed review. An obsolete approval cannot apply a replacement review.",
    "Unopened files are reread before original-service validation. Validation rejects before any document/history publication, and the current source, scope, review, read-only state and composition are checked before synchronous publication.",
    "Native validation failures retain the review for retry. Successful retry clears the old error. Publication installs all affected drafts/history together without disk writes and preserves each document undo history."
  ],
